     "text": [
      "ΔV=9.0 km/s | landing prop=430 t, booster dry=375 t → ship dry=174.6 t\n",
      "ΔV=9.4 km/s | landing prop=430 t, booster dry=375 t → ship dry=127.2 t\n"
